  "domain": "robotics",
  "definition": "The study and application of interpersonal and human-robot spatial relationships \u2014 including intimate, personal, social, and public distance zones \u2014 to design robotic systems that behave in spatially appropriate ways. Proxemics-aware robots adjust their approach trajectories, velocities, and stopping distances in response to detected human zones, improving perceived safety, comfort, and social acceptability in shared environments.",
